    "title": "Blackhawks Grind Out Road Win at Ansonia - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Gaylen Blosser / Editor ,\n13 hours ago ANSONIA — The Mississinawa Valley Blackhawks went on the road Tuesday night and earned a hard-fought 44-34 conference boys varsity basketball win over Ansonia. “We’ll take it,” said Mississinawa Valley coach Jeff Vaughn. “We know when we play Ansonia it’s always going to be a game. Throw the records out the door — it’s always competitive. It’s nice to go on the road and get a conference victory.” Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
